<title>USA: Trade estimates for US Census Bureau oilmill data.</title>
<headline>Trade estimates for US Census Bureau oilmill data.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade estimates for the monthly U.S. Census Bureau monthly oilmill report due to be issued Thursday at 0800EST/1300GMT. Data is for February 1997.</p>
<p>				   Range	   Average   January '97</p>
<p> Soy crushings-X	 125,000-128,000   125,875     137,265</p>
<p> Soycake/Meal stocks-Z 220,000-240,000   230,500     213,566</p>
<p>SOYOIL FACTORY AND WAREHOUSE STOCKS (Mln Lbs):</p>
<p>    Total		    2,190-2,210	 2,200	 2,169.3</p>
<p>(X=1,000 Bu, Z=Short Tons)</p>
